# Custom-syntax content that Prettier would corrupt if it reflowed it:
#   content/app/ui/*.md    — the `## group / ### key / field: value` UI-strings format
#                            (Prettier injects blank lines and breaks the one-line rule)
#   content/app/**         — results copy, tests, and other custom-parsed app content
#   content/books/*.md     — carry ==highlight=={colour} marks and deliberate verse
#                            line-breaks; Prettier rewrites emphasis and escapes the
#                            in-word underscores next to marks
# These are authored through the CMS or by hand and guarded by the editing note in
# AGENTS.md, not by Prettier.
sites/*/content/app
sites/*/content/books
